  {
   "id": "a01-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 767,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rule: settle the closest router not done yet, then update its neighbors.",
   "originalText": "Rule: settle the closest router not done yet, then update its neighbors.",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a01-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 120,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step  Settle    Update its neighbors                  Known so far\n----  --------  ------------------------------------  ------------------\n 1    S  (0)    E = 0+10 = 10     N = 0+15 = 15       S 0\n 2    E  (10)   D = 10+10 = 20                        S 0, E 10\n 3    N  (15)   D via N = 15+10 = 25 > 20, keep 20    S 0, E 10, N 15\n 4    D  (20)   nothing new                           S 0, E 10, N 15, D 20",
   "originalText": "Step  Settle    Update its neighbors                  Known so far\n----  --------  ------------------------------------  ------------------\n 1    S  (0)    E = 0+10 = 10     N = 0+15 = 15       S 0\n 2    E  (10)   D = 10+10 = 20                        S 0, E 10\n 3    N  (15)   D via N = 15+10 = 25 > 20, keep 20    S 0, E 10, N 15\n 4    D  (20)   nothing new                           S 0, E 10, N 15, D 20",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a01-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 330,
   "width": 64,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Result",
   "originalText": "Result",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a01-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 364,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "dist(S,E) = 10    dist(S,N) = 15    dist(S,D) = 20.  Shortest path to D: S → E → D, so the next hop for\nD is E.",
   "originalText": "dist(S,E) = 10    dist(S,N) = 15    dist(S,D) = 20.  Shortest path to D: S → E → D, so the next hop for\nD is E.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a01-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 417,
   "width": 426,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What SPF keeps for every router Y (§1.1)",
   "originalText": "What SPF keeps for every router Y (§1.1)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a01-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 451,
   "width": 953,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  dist(R,Y): the cheapest cost from the root R.\n•  ALL shortest-path predecessors, not just one: needed for ECMP.\n•  The first-hop set: which neighbors of R are on some shortest path to Y (these are the next hops).",
   "originalText": "•  dist(R,Y): the cheapest cost from the root R.\n•  ALL shortest-path predecessors, not just one: needed for ECMP.\n•  The first-hop set: which neighbors of R are on some shortest path to Y (these are the next hops).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a01-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 525,
   "width": 235,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The algorithm in short",
   "originalText": "The algorithm in short",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a01-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 559,
   "width": 711,
   "height": 140,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 134623,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1780393,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "dist[R] = 0, every other dist = ∞\nwhile some router is not settled:\n    X = the unsettled router with the smallest dist      (ties: lowest id)\n    settle X\n    for each link X→Y with metric c:\n        if dist[X] + c <  dist[Y]: dist[Y] = dist[X] + c, preds[Y] = {X}\n        if dist[X] + c == dist[Y]: add X to preds[Y]         (keeps ECMP)",
   "originalText": "dist[R] = 0, every other dist = ∞\nwhile some router is not settled:\n    X = the unsettled router with the smallest dist      (ties: lowest id)\n    settle X\n    for each link X→Y with metric c:\n        if dist[X] + c <  dist[Y]: dist[Y] = dist[X] + c, preds[Y] = {X}\n        if dist[X] + c == dist[Y]: add X to preds[Y]         (keeps ECMP)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
